ire"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Practical IT support for Bradford firms"},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Bradford’s business base leans towards manufacturing and owner-managed firms, sitting close enough to Leeds that many firms operate across both. It is a market where IT spend has to visibly earn itself rather than being taken on trust."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"That is a fair test and managed IT stands up to it: fewer outages because problems are caught by monitoring first, a service desk that resolves most issues remotely on the same working day, and one predictable monthly cost instead of unpredictable emergency invoices."}]}